WEBVTT

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.790
Dr. Fermi...

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:22.750
Why is he here?

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:26.300
Isn't he...

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.120
Spread your wings

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:41.750
See the light of hope in the sky you have yet to witness

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:45.050
And don't ever give in to the weight of sorrow

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:50.430
Echo unto eternity, "Unisonia"

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:59.690
That world you see before your eyes

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:05.280
I wonder what colors it is made of

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.740
The pain of loss isn't something

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.700
You want to get used to, and yet

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:17.670
Even on a night like this, the stars glisten

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:24.630
Like a tarnished coin spilling from the palm of your hand

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:26.470
Can't go back

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:27.880
Want to go home

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:31.220
The two of them back-to-back

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:33.260
Break through

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:38.020
Turning unfading emotions into a lasting bond

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:41.360
Like painting over a colorless world

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:44.070
Let this sympathy reach

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:50.320
Let's build the future that we envision

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:53.530
You'll see, we'll even change fate

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:58.330
Transcending time, "Unisonia"

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:10.690
Ensigns Weinberg and Watase, and Corporal Nasu,
you've been granted permission to disembark the airship.

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:14.960
If possible, move as a group. That is all.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:15.690
Yes, sir.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:20.900
Come on, you know how Dr. Fermi
hated it when people were all gloomy.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.110
Right.

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:25.410
Now then, here's my shopping list.

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:27.450
Huh? Elvira-san, you too?

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:29.190
What do you mean "you too"?

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:33.950
This one's from Anessa.

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:35.960
I see...

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:37.340
It's long.

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:43.100
Hey, wasn't that your dad at the church just now?

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.020
Yeah.

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:49.000
Aren't you going to say hello?

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.310
It's fine.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:56.320
Fiona told me about how you and your dad aren't very close.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:00.030
It's none of your business.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:01.070
It's not, but..

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.660
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.460
I couldn't decide on which clothes to wear.

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:11.460
We didn't wait that long.

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:12.330
Quick, hop in.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:13.790
Alright.

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:17.050
You look different when you're not wearing your uniform.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:20.970
I'm not used to wearing these kinds of clothes,
so I don't know if they look good on me.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.460
She looks great, doesn't she?

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:24.350
Yeah.

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:26.200
Don't answer half-heartedly!

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:27.680
Navi, to Ala Moana.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:28.930
Hey, don't ignore me!

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:36.820
Simulation practice?

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:40.780
To evaluate the performance of the Coupling System,

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:45.190
through computer-simulated missions for the mobile fleet.

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:48.830
Does that mean that Alliance
headquarters has approved of its use?

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:51.950
I would say in all likelihood.

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:59.170
Those sly old foxes back in the mainland remain indecisive and won't take the final step.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.590
Then this simulation practice is for...?

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.590
Yes, that's the idea.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:06.600
I want to get them all fired up.

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:11.350
There has been clear pressure from the financial and political factions.

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:14.920
We'll do our best to meet your expectations.

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:21.240
I wanted to go shopping.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.570
So, Anessa, you had to stay too, huh?

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:24.780
Fromm!

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:27.410
It's too bad we won't get a chance to see Hawaii.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.390
No, not at all!

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:31.410
I asked Mayuka to go shopping for me.

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:33.630
Mind if I sit next to you?

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:34.830
Sure.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:36.320
Let's eat together!

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:42.660
That's all the cosmetics off Anessa's list done.

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:43.970
After that...

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:45.450
Hey, Dio.

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:46.340
What?

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:49.100
Do you want me to talk to your father for you?

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.570
<i>You?</i>

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:52.100
What're you talking about?

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.940
I mean, he won't listen to what you say.

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:57.450
He has no reason to listen to you.

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:00.570
But if it goes on like this, won't you feel sorry for Fiona?

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:05.450
Don't you know how worried
she is about you and your father?

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.450
I told you it's none of your business.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:08.530
But you...

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:09.990
Geez, you're annoying! Shut up!

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:12.540
Please stop it, both of you.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.130
Stop, Navi.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:22.190
H-Hey, what are you doing?

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:23.290
Wait, Dio!

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:24.530
I'll go by myself.

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:26.220
Didn't they tell us to stick together?!

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:28.180
They said "if possible".

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.140
Hey! Come back, Dio!
Dio!

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:30.650
Hey! Come back, Dio!

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:32.600
Hey! Hey!

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:35.640
What the hell...

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:37.490
Let's go, Mayuka-chan.

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:38.620
Eh? But...

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:39.360
It's fine.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:41.360
Let that guy be.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:54.660
You are not supposed to waste your time here.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:06:00.290
Even if other people blame you, I will always forgive you.

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:04.590
Is that Young Master Dio?

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:07.670
It really is you!

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:09.680
Paul?

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:20.730
My father was a firefighter.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:26.770
He had a strong sense of justice and was a very passionate person.

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:31.820
"It's the man's job to protect his family", is what he would always say to me.

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:36.120
That's why when my father died, I thought to myself,

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:40.370
"From now on, I'm going to protect my family by myself."

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:42.910
But you know,

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:46.050
after I joined the basketball club
in middle school, I forgot about it.

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:50.940
By the time I remembered, it was already too late.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:57.390
Even though I promised myself that I'd
protect my family, I haven't done anything.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:02.480
If you're living in the same time period,
it's a waste to be estranged from your family.

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:04.380
Aoba-san...

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:07.610
Huh?

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:10.360
Isn't that...

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.450
Fiona!

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:15.910
Aoba-san!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.930
What did you want to talk about?

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:22.540
About the previous battle.

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:28.590
I've analyzed Zogilia's tactics and I've confirmed that Hahn was definitely involved.

00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:34.300
Hahn? Your colleague that Dr. Fermi was talking about?

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:35.820
Yes.

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:41.390
I'm afraid he's now in a position where he's able to review and modify their battle tactics.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:42.190
That would mean...

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:45.410
Future encounters will be more dangerous.

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:46.190
Indeed.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.370
What kind of person is he?

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:50.610
He's a brilliant man.

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:52.800
To the point where I don't even wanna remember.

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:56.370
Elvira?

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.830
She was an excellent engineer.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.750
After me, that is.

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:04.810
The cockpit she created is the key.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:07.040
Just bring that back to me.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:11.850
Our airframe is superior to theirs.

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:21.430
Even as her father, I had difficulty with that teenaged girl.
You've done a find job training her.

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:24.940
As expected of Lieutenant Colonel Alfried.

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:28.810
Her excellent performance has been an asset to us all.

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:31.680
Lieutenant Commander Ryazan, it's good to see that you're well.

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:35.450
And you as well, Lieutenant Colonel.
You've got that fire in your eyes.

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:39.910
You don't seem like the kind of person who would
fail to protect the leader of the Imperial Guard.

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:42.250
Harsh as always.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.630
The Alliance's Valiancer?

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:51.870
Yes. We will sneak into Hawaii base and steal it.

00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:52.840
Is that even possible?

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.930
Of course. That's our job, after all.

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:57.550
I see.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:09:00.120
Would you like something to drink?

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:03.930
Milk? Maybe grape juice?

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:06.830
Please stop it. We're not kids anymore.

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:08.230
That's true.

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:11.780
It sure has been a while. You've grown a lot.

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:14.310
What nonsense are you talking about?

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:19.780
L-Lieutenant Commander! It was just a joke!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:22.910
For this plan, you'll go naked.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.290
No way...

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.120
Ensign.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:26.670
Yes, sir!

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:29.250
You'll also participate in our plan.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:29.840
Eh?

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.700
This is all Lieutenant Colonel Alfried's idea.

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:36.430
I heard you've used the new-type mecha's interface.

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:40.780
That knowledge is key to making the plan run smoothly, alright?

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:41.880
Yes, sir.

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:48.740
Especially since you seem to have an attachment to the white one.

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:51.580
The Lieutenant Colonel has given you a chance.

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:54.400
Lieutenant Commander,
please allow me to participate as well.

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:56.280
First Lieutenant Gerafil, too?

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:59.950
The new-type mechas operate cooperatively with two working together as one.

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:03.990
I'd be the perfect operative for this mission
since I've gone on the most missions with her.

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:09.420
Well, I guess I can rely on you to look after Hina.

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.290
I'm counting on you, Bizon.

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:12.380
Yes, sir.

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:16.450
I'll talk to the Lieutenant Colonel about it.

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:18.100
Prepare their equipment.

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:18.800
Yes, sir!

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:22.790
And also a teddy bear for Hina.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.980
Wow, you even have a mansion here.

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.250
Yes.

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:36.860
It's good to see the two of you here.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.700
What happened to Dio?

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:39.490
Eh?

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:40.910
Oh, yes...

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:41.660
He's fine.

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:43.340
I see.

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:50.000
With your father?

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:52.000
Yes.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:54.590
It was during our lunch.

00:10:55.320 --> 00:11:00.680
I was telling Father to sit down and talk to Dio once more,

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:06.600
but he wouldn't listen to me. I felt so sad.

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:10.140
So, you couldn't help leaving the restaurant.

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:11.230
Yes.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:14.130
Man. Both father and son are so stubborn.

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:15.150
Aoba-san!

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:17.320
Did something happen to Dio?

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:20.760
Eh? Nope. It's nothing.

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:22.780
Alright! Let's turn around!

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:26.740
I should really talk to your father.
I'll make sure he gets it.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:27.500
What?

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:29.910
I think that's impossible.

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:30.830
Why?

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:35.380
My father won't listen to someone
he just met for the first time.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:39.210
Besides, even if I asked, he probably wouldn't see you.

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:40.300
But...

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:43.870
I appreciate the thought, but I'm sorry.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:50.230
Well then, to change the mood,
why don't you come shopping with us?

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.060
Huh?

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:53.740
Is it all right for me to accompany you?

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:54.730
Of course!

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:57.070
But aren't you two on a date?

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:01.290
No, that's not it. We're not like that.

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:01.950
Right?

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:04.440
Eh? Yeah...

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:05.450
Then I'd love to!

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:06.890
Alright! It's decided!

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:08.290
Where do you wanna go?
A date...

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:09.660
Let's see...

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:13.670
You came at the right time.

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:17.320
Fiona-sama was just here a little while ago.

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:18.550
Fiona was?

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:22.640
Pardon me.

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:37.610
But if it goes on like this, won't you feel sorry for Fiona?

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:48.160
We heard you're neighbors.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:51.390
They moved in when I was 10 years old.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.470
At that time,

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:56.940
I would've never dreamed of having the famous and
valiant Lieutenant Commander Ryazan as a neighbor.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:14:00.110
Come to think of it, where did you
guys live before moving in?

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:03.230
Hmm? Well, here and there.

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:04.640
With Hina?

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:05.940
That's right.

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:11.980
<i>That reminds me, before moving next door to Bizon, I...</i>

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:14.540
Hey, we're here.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.250
I've been waiting for this!

00:14:17.430 --> 00:14:19.850
Alright! Pass the glasses around.

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:27.090
A toast to the plan's success and the prosperity of our country!

00:14:27.430 --> 00:14:28.470
Here you go.

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:30.050
I'm still not...

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.890
You're a grown-up, right?

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:33.310
Yes.

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:36.810
Here's to the Goddess of War.
May she grant us luck in our battle.

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:38.710
Glory to Zogilia.

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:40.560
Glory to Zogilia!

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:51.320
Grape juice?

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:15.100
You took care of us back at Chitose.

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:16.720
You have my gratitude.

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:19.310
It was my mission.

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:26.070
Why were you at Dr. Fermi's funeral?

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:29.330
The doctor and I were friends.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:34.280
My company funded his research on several occasions.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:36.620
Is that so?

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:40.250
Thanks to that, I've heard about many things.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.830
I see you got yourself a special Buddy.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.800
Watase Aoba, right?

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:47.710
Yes.

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:50.920
After Coupling with him,

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:53.550
your Emphater waveform deviated from the standard...

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:57.550
and you weren't able to do Coupling with other Couplers.

00:15:57.550 --> 00:16:02.270
If I go through retraining, there's a chance
my waveform could return to normal.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.940
Is there any proof?

00:16:04.390 --> 00:16:05.690
No.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:10.740
What did you say when you joined the army?

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:15.370
I want to protect my family and everyone else.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:18.720
To become a Coupler that can't freely choose his Buddy...

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.950
Would you call that a soldier?

00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:26.540
The guy was a mere civilian.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.630
He'll be shot down by an enemy soon.

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:32.780
When that happens, only one good-for-nothing will remain.

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:35.760
A soldier who couldn't even protect his family.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:41.600
It's not too late. Leave the army.

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:46.300
Being in the front lines is not the only way to protect your country.

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:52.110
That guy... won't get shot down that easily.

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:56.030
How can you be so sure? This is war.

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:58.910
It's not that easy. You should know better.

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:04.280
Sure, that guy lacks the resolve,

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:07.500
easily interacts with the enemy,

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:11.900
is stupid, oblivious, careless,

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:16.840
and steps on other people's feelings without a second thought.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.890
He's a nosy and troublesome guy.

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:23.100
But that guy can... he can...

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:25.560
What about that guy?!

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:28.650
You're just saying you're still immature!

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:34.540
Enough. I understand.

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:36.030
You can go.

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:44.010
I'm glad we had this chance to talk.

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:44.620
Hmm?

00:17:44.920 --> 00:17:48.880
I'm happy that you're worried about me.

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:51.460
Well then, I'll be leaving now.

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.260
You've changed.

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:02.760
Come see us sometime.

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:04.520
It'll make Fiona happy.

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:07.020
Yes.

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:15.730
That was fun!

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:17.340
Yeah, it was.

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:18.660
Feeling better?

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:19.450
Yup!

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:21.800
Then it's time to head back.

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:22.410
Eh?

00:18:22.890 --> 00:18:25.390
Your father must be worried, right?

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:28.040
I think it's about time we went back.

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:31.450
Don't worry! I won't let him say a thing!

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:32.920
Aoba-san!

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:37.260
You're right. I'll go back.

00:18:40.940 --> 00:18:42.350
This restaurant?

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:43.280
Yes.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:47.560
This is where Dio got out.

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:50.230
Was he with you?

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:53.780
Yeah. Sorry for not telling you.

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:55.530
Ah. It's Dio.

00:18:58.220 --> 00:19:00.080
So he was eating.

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:01.950
Don't tell me...!

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:03.910
Fiona?

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.830
Why are you with Aoba and Corporal Nasu?

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:10.290
We met along the way and they invited me to go shopping with them.

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.210
Were you eating lunch?

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.250
Yeah.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:14.840
Could it be?

00:19:15.990 --> 00:19:17.210
With Father.

00:19:17.530 --> 00:19:19.070
Is that so?

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:29.600
What's up with that guy?
He was able to talk to him after all.

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:31.940
He could've done it if he wanted to.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:36.530
Your words must've pushed him forward, Aoba-san.

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:39.530
And he was really against it.
He's not being honest, isn't he?

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:54.920
Aoba-san.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:58.960
Do you want to go back?

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:01.260
To your own time period?

00:20:03.190 --> 00:20:06.510
You don't want to stay in this time period?

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:12.520
Sorry. I'm not sure.

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:14.650
I see.

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:17.270
Corporal Nasu.

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:19.570
Fiona wants to thank you for taking care of her.

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:21.000
Oh, it was nothing.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:25.070
Fiona, you will be infected with stupidity
if you go near this guy. Avoid him like the plague.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:27.100
What was that, you bastard?

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.930
I understand, Dio.

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:32.040
What?! You too, Fiona?

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:34.620
That's so mean.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:36.780
You said something weird to her, didn't you?

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:38.040
I don't know.

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:43.010
Begin simulation practice.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:46.800
Coupling mode activated. Time limit is 300 seconds.

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.560
Luxon, Bradyon, counter all enemy attacks.

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:59.490
Two Valiancers, two Battle Airships...

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:02.570
So this is the Coupling System.

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:06.280
The plan's primary goal has been reached. All units, please—

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:18.210
Aoba-san, Dio, great job!

00:21:18.490 --> 00:21:21.800
Elvira-san said the simulation practice was flawless.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:25.510
You were 0.2 seconds too fast on hitting the Code T2 Rise!

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:29.180
You were too slow! Not enough spirit, I guess!

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:31.100
Because you were in a hurry,

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:33.490
we missed three enemies we could've destroyed!

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:35.600
That's not the case at all! You're exaggerating!

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:35.860
I'm not exaggerating, you idiot!

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:37.570
Good grief.

00:21:37.570 --> 00:21:37.900
I'm not exaggerating, you idiot!

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:47.620
The plan has started.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:49.320
Okay.

00:22:15.340 --> 00:22:19.100
With my heart, I call out

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:23.470
To the far side, mutually drawn

00:22:23.470 --> 00:22:27.980
Forgetting even the reason I ache

00:22:27.980 --> 00:22:32.610
Just for now, please

00:22:32.610 --> 00:22:36.780
I know you

00:22:36.780 --> 00:22:41.280
I'm searching for you

00:22:41.410 --> 00:22:43.750
Softly pressing my lips

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:50.380
to the bright afterimage I can't keep from leaving

00:22:50.380 --> 00:22:58.930
If hesitation is what gives way to the slightest of hopes

00:22:58.930 --> 00:23:03.510
To the many gentle mornings...

00:23:03.510 --> 00:23:08.060
and the times I have wondered

00:23:08.060 --> 00:23:12.320
In the future that leads back to that sky,

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:14.570
I want to save you,

00:23:14.570 --> 00:23:16.650
I want to protect you

00:23:16.650 --> 00:23:21.030
In the future that arrives at that dream

00:23:21.030 --> 00:23:23.910
Wait for me

00:23:23.910 --> 00:23:28.660
The love we'll surely find

00:23:28.660 --> 00:23:33.460
I want you to reach out for it

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:38.560
Next episode, on Buddy Complex:

00:23:38.560 --> 00:23:39.710
"The Truth."
